  "description": "RUJHAH crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C40 H60 O20 Yb4,C7 H8. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1E (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1K (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1N (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.571-3.816 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.35-112.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C40H60O20Yb4·C7H8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
